# MOL-833: concurrent PRs that each shift a scanned source line both rewrite
# .reports/architecture/derived/*.json. Without this, every merge conflicts on
# those generated files and the only correct resolution is a manual regen.
#
# merge=ours takes the current branch's copy during a clean merge so the paths
# never conflict. Requires `merge.ours.driver=true` (wired by setup-hooks.sh).
# .githooks/post-merge then runs `tools.arch regen` against the *merged* source
# and leaves a fresh working tree (commit is a follow-up). Do NOT use a custom
# merge driver that regens mid-merge — other paths may still be unmerged then.
.reports/architecture/derived/** merge=ours
